# UI

- Props types come from `@/content` (`Site`, `Product`, `CollageImage`).
- Product rails and collage map over SSOT arrays. Do not slice a hardcoded four filenames.
- Internal routes: `next/link`. External social: `<a target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">`.
- Collage grid stays `gap-0`. Hero uses `site.heroImageSrc`, not a bag photo.

```tsx
// BAD
<img src="/bags/leopard.jpeg" alt="Leopard" />

// GOOD
<Image src={product.imageSrc} alt={product.name} />
```
